''This was the first initial version of Booster Pack #2 for the [[Afterbirth †]] DLC expansion. For an overview on content added in Booster Pack #2, please see this page: [[Booster Pack]]s''

== Documented changes ==
=== New items ===
* {{i|Jumper Cables}} (520), which is based off [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=846644717 this Steam Workshop item] by Ashkait & Scayze.
* {{i|Coupon}} (521), which is based off [https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=839401874 this Steam Workshop item] by Plumbo.
* {{i|Telekinesis}} (522), which is based off [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=857187975 this Steam Workshop item] by Eufuu.
* {{i|Moving Box}} (523), which is based off [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=858673093 this Steam Workshop item] by Tim l'enchanteur.
* {{i|Technology Zero}} (524), which is based off [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=850840324 this Steam Workshop item] by Ashkait & Scayze.
* {{i|Leprosy}} (525), which was inspired by [https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=840814967 this Steam Workshop item] by Extreme Ninja Home Makeover.

=== New trinkets ===
* {{t|Filigree Feather}} (123)

=== New features ===
* Added bomb synergy graphics, which is based off of this [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=854593270 this Steam Workshop mod] by S-body.
* Added a custom {{i|Jar of Flies}} sprite depending on how many flies you have, which is based off of this [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=840463618 this Steam Workshop mod] by Stewartisme.
* A [[Mom's dressing table]] will now spawn in the starting room of every floor if you have 8 or more collectible items. You can bomb it once per floor to yield the same rewards as a random grey chest. It is not affected by [[Mom's Key]]. It is based off of this [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=859294029 this Steam Workshop mod] by Sinsthar.
* Angel Rooms now function similar to Treasure Rooms in that if there is more than 1 pedestal item, touching one will make all of the others disappear.
* Changed some Angel Rooms:
** Added an additional pedestal item to room #1 (the room with 1 statues and 1 item pedestal).
** Added an eternal heart to room #2 (the room with 1 statue and 1 item pedestal).
** Added 4 eternal hearts and removed 2 soul hearts from room #3 (the room with 1 statue and 3 soul hearts).
** Added 3 item pedestals and removed 2 eternal hearts from room #4 (the room with 2 eternal hearts).
** Added 6 more blue fires to room #5 (the room with 1 statue and 1 item pedestal).
** Added an item pedestal to room #6 (the room with 1 statue and 1 item pedestal).
** Added 4 item pedestals and removed 3 soul hearts and removed 1 eternal heart from room room #7 (the room with 1 eternal heart and 4 soul hearts behind locked blocks).
** Added an additional pedestal item to room #9 (the narrow room with 1 statues and 1 item pedestal).
** Added an additional pedestal item to room #12 (the room with 2 statues and 1 item pedestal).
** Added two additional pedestal items and removed 3 soul hearts from room #13 (the room with 1 statue and 5 soul hearts).
** Added an extra soul heart to room #14 (the room with 2 items).
** Added 3 pedestal items and removed 2 soul hearts from room #15 (the room with 2 soul hearts and 2 statues).
* Added a new transformation called [[Stompy]] upon getting three size up items (such as {{i|Magic Mushroom}} or a [[One Makes You Larger]] pill). After attaining this transformation, the player will create dust clouds when walking and have a chance to spawn the {{i|Wait What?}} effect upon getting hit.

== Undocumented changes ==
=== Additions ===
* Active items charge during Challenge Room waves.
* {{i|Angry Fly}} now counts towards [[Beelzebub]].
* Added Booster Pack #1 items to the [[Greed mode]] pool.

=== Changes ===
* Enabling mods no longer disables achievements after beating [[Mom's Heart]].
* The {{i|Broken Modem}} sprite now has an outline.
* {{i|Lil Delirium}} is now unlocked with {{i|Delirious}}.

=== Fixes ===
* Fixed the bug where the Treasure Room item pool was yielding {{i|Breakfast}} before the pool was actually depleted.
* Fixed the bug where the {{i|Ipecac}} and {{i|Lead Pencil}} synergy caused unavoidable damage.
* Fixed the bug where {{i|Loki's Horns}} would not properly unlock.
* Fixed the bug where dropped pickup positions were unseeded.
* Fixed the bug where rerolled item pedestals from {{i|Pandora's Box}} were unseeded.
* Fixed the bug where {{i|Tech X}} would not work on [[Azazel]].
* Fixed the bug where the drops from {{i|Lil Chest}} were unseeded.
* Fixed the bug where the payouts from {{i|Crystal Ball}} were unseeded.
* Fixed the bug where the number of enemies from [[Portal]]s were unseeded.
* Fixed the bug where the void portal that appeared after [[Mom]] was incorrectly textured.
* Fixed the bug where familiars with a charge component would automatically fire upon entering a boss room.

== New bugs ==
* The {{i|Leprosy}} item is misspelled as "Leperocy".
* The [[Boss Rush]] gives double the amount of charges that it is supposed to, since it awards charges at both the beginning and the end of every wave.
* Entering the [[Devil room]] with the new item {{i|Coupon}} often causes the game to crash.

